{
  "description": "The engine's former class other is a rule: any character that is no letter ('\\p{L}'), nonspacing mark ('\\p{Mn}'), digit ('0'..'9') or whitespace ('\\p{White_Space}'). So q, 漢 and a combining diaeresis are not in it, and a spacing mark such as U+0903 is (design §4, engine §1).",
  "grammar": "%rule text [{c}]\n%rule c $x:other :: O | $y:_ :: N %conditions ¬($y.matches(other)) %emits $\n\n\n\n\n\n\n%rule other $c:_ %conditions ¬($c.matches(alpha)), ¬($c.matches(mark)), ¬($c.matches(digit)), ¬($c.matches(space))\n\n\n\n\n\n\n%rule alpha _L\n%rule mark _Mn\n%rule digit \"0\"..\"9\"\n%rule space _White_Space",
  "input": "q漢ï!7 «€ ः",
  "expect": {
    "result": {
      "ok": true,
      "stages": [
        {
          "verdict": "unique",
